John 8:1 , Christ delivers the woman taken in adultery;
John 8:12 , He declares himself the light of the world, and justifies his doctrine;
John 8:31 , promises freedom to those who believe;
John 8:33 , answers the Jews that boasted of Abraham;
John 8:48 , answers their reviling, by shewing his authority and dignity;
John 8:59 , and conveys himself from their cruelty.
